Fourteen years as a LoadRunner/VuGen specialist — with direct SAP CRM and BRIM performance testing experience — makes this Senior Performance Engineering Architect role at Sarum LLC a strong mutual fit.

At Sprint/CenturyLink, I led performance testing across SAP CRM and ERP environments, scaling telecom-grade systems to 12,000+ transactions per minute while defining workload models, load profiles, and SLA acceptance criteria. At USDA, I drove a 40% throughput increase and reduced defect resolution time 35% by integrating AppDynamics, Splunk, and Grafana for full-stack observability — the same monitoring strategy your architecture requires across SAP, middleware, database, and cloud layers. SLA compliance enforcement (sub-5s transactions, sub-2s services) and automated performance regression testing have been standard deliverables throughout my career. I've also worked with NeoLoad alongside JMeter and LoadRunner, and I'm ready to lead its enterprise implementation on the Journi program.

This remote contract aligns perfectly with my availability. I'd welcome the conversation — please reach out at your earliest convenience.
