The AI Reliability Engineer role is a natural fit for my background. At the USDA, I led performance validation for AWS/Kubernetes migrations, integrated Prometheus, Grafana, Splunk, and AppDynamics into full-stack observability pipelines, and enforced SLA thresholds of under five seconds per transaction at scale — increasing system throughput 40% and cutting defect resolution time 35%. Monitoring model latency, inference throughput, and SLA compliance is the same engineering work I've done on production systems for two decades.

